-### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
-*   **Densification Disabled**: When `opt.include_feature` is `True`, densification and pruning are completely skipped [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Checkpoint Loading**: If loading a checkpoint that contains 12 model parameters (indicating language feature support), `opt.include_feature` must be `True` [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Feature Masking**: The language feature loss requires a valid `language_feature_mask` [S1, unofficial].
+**Pitfalls:**
+*   Densification and pruning are strictly disabled when `opt.include_feature` is `true`. Attempting to enable them may lead to instability or incorrect semantic convergence [S1, unofficial].
+*   Checkpoint loading logic depends on the number of model parameters. If the checkpoint has 12 parameters, `opt.include_feature` must be `true` to ensure correct initialization; otherwise, `first_iter` must be reset to 0 [S1, unofficial].
 
